Package: WISESurv
Type: Package
Title: Sharp Bounds for Long-Term Survival Extrapolation
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("WISESurv", "Authors", email = "wisesurv@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: WISESurv Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: WISESurv Authors <wisesurv@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Computes assumption-indexed sharp bounds for long-term survival
    benefit from two-arm randomized trials. The package represents unknown
    post-trial survival tails as complete trajectories subject to transparent
    scientific and external-evidence restrictions, solves sparse linear
    programs for restricted mean survival time and discounted survival utility,
    diagnoses incompatible restriction sets, and supports robust net monetary
    benefit decisions.
